{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Your garment.</b> Some say [it means] a sign, and others say that they took many garments out of Egypt. And it is possible that there is in the nature of the manna no [tendency] to produce sweat." "<b>Did not swell.</b> From the root of ויאפו את הבצק (and they baked the dough), for it is the way of the feet of a pedestrian who walks a long road that his feet swell. And it is possible that HaShem gave them strength, or led them gently."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:48.422141633Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}